   "xp": 1020
  },
  {
   "copper": 45,
   "description": "The Tithe Revenants on the Dur Brannoc Heights, which lie in the northwest of Dur Brannoc, still collect a tithe that was abolished before my grandmother's beard went grey. Put six of them down at night if you have the time; it isn't the road's most urgent business, but I'd like the ledger to stop arguing with the dead.",
   "giver": "r20_dwarf_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Dorrin Gateledger",
   "giver_settlement": "Dur Brannoc",
   "id": "durbrannoc_gate_optional",
