   "xp": 595
  },
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "The forge bell rings, the doors open, and suddenly every dwarf in Dur Brannoc is starving. Hunt six Hill Rams by day on the Dur Brannoc Heights, which lie in the northwest of Dur Brannoc, then come back for your bounty. It's repeatable twenty minutes after you hand it in; I've yet to meet a city that stays fed.",
   "giver": "r20_dwarf_capital_cook",
