  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Dur Brannoc's walls are sound, but the Accord cannot shelter behind them all at once. Report to Toren Waterbarrel at Cinderline Watch in Ashenward March; he needs capable hands on that contested ground. We keep our word to our allies by turning up when the work gets hard.",
   "giver": "r20_dwarf_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Dorrin Gateledger",
