   "title": "The Weight of Our Word",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_036_host",
   "xp": 175
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "A mountain hold stands because every stone bears its share, and the Accord needs yours on contested ground. Report to Borin Splitbolt at Splitbolt Station in Stormvault Heights; you've kept our roads open, and he'll find a use for that steadiness.",
