  {
   "copper": 800,
   "description": "There's an elite stone golem, Stone Golem Rime-Bell, guarding the Wyrmglass Spires northwest from here, and the clan wants its bell silenced. Gather a full group, take a boat each to the Wyrmglass Crown and destroy the golem. I've a payment ready and a space in the record for everyone who comes back.",
