   "copper": 600,
   "description": "The clan has placed another order for Rime Sinew, with an impressive number of signatures from dwarves staying home. Take a boat to the Wyrmglass Crown and hunt Rimehorn Rams by day on the Wyrmglass Scree. Bring me four Rime Sinew for payment. You can take this bounty again one hour after each turn-in; I'll keep the signatories busy finding your coin.",
